Description: LXQt schedule management daemon and command-line client
 Provides a session D-Bus daemon and command-line client for creating,
 updating, listing, and removing schedules. Reminders support one-time,
 daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly recurrence and are stored locally.
 .
 Due reminders are delivered through the desktop notification service.
 Listings mark entries with identical due timestamps as conflicting.
 Integration resources are available for the LXQt worldclock calendar
 and the bibit-intent natural language assistant.
